# Ed301 laboratory OpenSSL overlay

Installing `ed301-openssl-provider-policy` activates the private-use Ed301 TLS
test provider and installs an OpenSSL configuration overlay. The overlay
places the private-use `ed301_eddsa_v1_test` signature algorithm before the
nonempty signature-algorithm list generated by the selected Fedora crypto
policy.

This is not a native Fedora `.pmod`. Do not install or retain this package with
FIPS, BSI, EMPTY or another policy whose OpenSSL algorithm set is closed.
Remove the package and regenerate the selected crypto policy before switching
to such a policy.

The ordinary `ed301_eddsa_v1.so` provider remains globally inactive and is
available only through explicit application loading.
